/// If [clipBehavior] is [Clip.none], no clipping will be applied.␀␀À␀…:À␀„îSÀ␀…:./// If non-null, determines which clip to use.␀À␀…¶À␀…F|À␀…¶^/// {@macro flutter.rendering.ClipRectLayer.clipBehavior}
///
/// Defaults to [Clip.hardEdge].␀␀␀␀␀À␀…õÀ␀…õÀ␀†␀À␀…ÇÀ␀…ÈÀ␀…ÇÀ␀…Ç€’À␀…â␀␀␀␀À␀†À␀†À␀†␀␀␀À␀†—À␀†—À␀†¦␀À␀†]À␀†^À␀†]À␀†]€¬À␀†n␀␀␀␀À␀‡5À␀‡5À␀‡D␀À␀‡À␀‡À␀‡À␀‡kÀ␀‡␀␀␀␀À␀‡¡À␀‡¡&À␀‡½␀À␀‡|À␀‡}À␀‡|À␀‡|€ğÀ␀‡␀␀À␀~şÀ␀~ş‰pÀ␀ƒ‰„„/// A widget that clips its child using a rectangle.
///
/// By default, [ClipRect] prevents its child from painting outside its
/// bounds, but the size and location of the clip rect can be customized using a
/// custom [clipper].
///
/// [ClipRect] is commonly used with these widgets, which commonly paint outside
/// their bounds:
///
///  * [CustomPaint]
///  * [CustomSingleChildLayout]
///  * [CustomMultiChildLayout]
