///  * [EdgeInsets], the class that is used to describe the padding dimensions.
///  * [AnimatedPadding], which animates changes in [padding] over a given
///    duration.
///  * [SliverPadding], the sliver equivalent of this widget.
///  * The [catalog of layout widgets](https://flutter.dev/widgets/layout/).␀␀ÀS/␀ÀS4␀␀␀␀ÀS;ÀS;	ÀSA␀␀␀ÀSJÀSJ!ÀSO␀␀␀ÀSqÀSqÀSv␀␀␀ÀS‡ÀS‡ÀSŒ␀␀␀ÀSÀSÀS¤␀ÀS[ÀSdÀSeÀS²ÀS¸ÀSâÀSÍÀSÅÀS¹ÀSÈÀSÜÀSĞÀSßÀSìÀSòÀTÀTÀT␀ÀSóÀTÀTÀTÀTÀRÌÀRÌT␀V/// Creates an alignment widget.
///
/// The alignment defaults to [Alignment.center].␀␀ÀWcÀT$ƒHÀWcƒ/// How to align the child.
