///    own size and positions the child according to an [Alignment] value.
///  * The [catalog of layout widgets](https://flutter.dev/widgets/layout/).␀␀Àa␀Àa␀␀␀␀Àa	Àa		Àa␀␀␀ÀaÀaÀa␀␀␀Àa'Àa'Àa-␀␀␀Àa;Àa;ÀaA␀␀À`ÌÀ`Ì}␀,/// Creates a widget that centers its child.␀␀␀␀␀␀À\‹À\‹„ÀÀ`³„!/// A widget that centers its child within itself.
